# Parts Specification: Front-Mount Intercooler Kit

**SKU:** MMINT-FMIC-02

**Part ID:** 102

**Category:** Forced Induction / Cooling

**Manufacturer:** Mishimoto

## Compatibility

Requires the turbo kit (`part_id 101`) to already be installed, since the hot-side piping bolts directly to the turbo's compressor outlet.

Bumper cover must be trimmed for core clearance — not compatible with vehicles running the factory bumper support bar without modification.

Silicone couplers included are rated to 3 bar / 180°C. Do not reuse factory rubber couplers, as they are not rated for the boost levels this turbo kit produces.

## Torque Specs

- **Coupler T-bolt clamps:** 8 Nm. Do not overtighten — silicone couplers can be damaged above 10 Nm.
- **Core mounting bracket bolts:** 12 Nm.
- **Piping support bracket bolts:** 9 Nm.

## Installation Order

**Install After:** `part_id 101`

The intercooler must be installed after the turbo kit because the hot-side piping connects directly to the turbo compressor outlet.

## Special Instructions

Pressure-test the full charge-air piping circuit to 1.5x expected peak boost before first start to catch coupler leaks early.